{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_011xN6MEwrF287WpNVbQZbjQ","type":"tool_result","content":"287\t**Summary**: Third attempt at this optimization. Implemented batched CUDA kernels (Round0ZcCtx/Round0LogupCtx descriptors, 1D grid with BlockCtx mapping, batched reduction), FFI bindings, and a round0_batched.rs orchestration module that writes directly to d_batch_array via existing GPU extraction kernels. Also added PRUNE_SHMEM_KERNELS compile flag to halve Round 0 template instantiations (reduces cubin from 9.3M to 6.5M). APC 0 shows no regression (batch path inactive, 20 AIRs < 50-AIR threshold). APC 100/300 OOM at vpmm_create_physical during GKR input eval — this OOM reproduces even on unmodified code after any CUDA rebuild, indicating the cached Apr 8 binary had barely enough headroom that any build system change pushes over.\n288\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"694fb196-69bb-4e1f-a777-5a160503c446","uuid":"851a8fbe-fa71-4a94-b13b-f055c7d2bab9","timestamp":"2026-04-15T13:37:41.956Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/georg/stark-backend/autoopt-results/log.md","content":"**Summary**: Third attempt at this optimization. Implemented batched CUDA kernels (Round0ZcCtx/Round0LogupCtx descriptors, 1D grid with BlockCtx mapping, batched reduction), FFI bindings, and a round0_batched.rs orchestration module that writes directly to d_batch_array via existing GPU extraction kernels. Also added PRUNE_SHMEM_KERNELS compile flag to halve Round 0 template instantiations (reduces cubin from 9.3M to 6.5M). APC 0 shows no regression (batch path inactive, 20 AIRs < 50-AIR threshold). APC 100/300 OOM at vpmm_create_physical during GKR input eval — this OOM reproduces even on unmodified code after any CUDA rebuild, indicating the cached Apr 8 binary had barely enough headroom that any build system change pushes over.\n","numLines":2,"startLine":287,"totalLines":288}}}
