{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01S3CD9EA5XkNUn9b5X6jGEV","type":"tool_result","content":"=== task.md ===\n# 2026-04-15-1600-fix-batch-round0-revert-and-reapply\n\nRevert the broken batch-round0-descriptors commit (0d1bb2f9) which causes APC 300 STARK proving to hang for 12+ minutes, then re-apply the batch Round 0 path with the CPU bottleneck fixed. The existing batch code redundantly reconstructs logup interaction DAGs and rules per batchable AIR via `build_logup_rules_for_air()` (involving `SymbolicDagBuilder`, `SymbolicRulesGpu::new`, and per-AIR device uploads), which takes prohibitively long for the ~300 small AIRs at APC 300. The fix reuses the precomputed `logup_round0_buffer_size` from `AirDataGpu` and the existing per-AIR logup rule data (DAG, rules, weights) that the non-batched path already constructs during Phase 1 work-item preparation, avoiding all redundant CPU-side symbolic computation.\n\n=== plan.md exists ===\n-rw-rw-r-- 1 georg georg 12802 Apr 15 16:25 /home/georg/stark-backend/autoopt-results/2026-04-15-1600-fix-batch-round0-revert-and-reapply/plan.md\n\n=== baseline exists ===\napc000.json\napc100.json\napc300.json\n\n=== current measurements ===\n1050624 /home/georg/stark-backend/autoopt-results/current_apc000.json\n1457147 /home/georg/stark-backend/autoopt-results/current_apc100.json\n2092788 /home/georg/stark-backend/autoopt-results/current_apc300.json\n4600559 total\n\n=== nsight profile ===\n-rw-rw-r-- 1 georg georg 5373228 Apr 15 16:11 /home/georg/stark-backend/autoopt-results/current_nsys_apc300.nsys-rep\n\n=== no source code modified ===\n[rerun: b66]","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"694fb196-69bb-4e1f-a777-5a160503c446","uuid":"d2b60b87-c00c-4aae-80f4-a6655b741486","timestamp":"2026-04-15T14:25:30.956Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"=== task.md ===\n# 2026-04-15-1600-fix-batch-round0-revert-and-reapply\n\nRevert the broken batch-round0-descriptors commit (0d1bb2f9) wh